%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
newpath 0 0 moveto 10 0 lineto 10 10 lineto clip newpath 0 0 5 5 rectfill
newpath 20 20 moveto 30 20 lineto 30 30 lineto eoclip 1 1 moveto 2 2 lineto stroke
clippath 3 3 moveto 4 4 lineto stroke
initclip 5 5 moveto 6 6 lineto stroke
